<p>Like Petrograd, I had a hard time visualizing how this works, but after going back and forth between the first exploration and the description, I had at least enough of an idea to follow along.</p>
<p>Anyway, great, classic exploration horror. I don't even know what you call it, but it's always worked for the SCP format, and this article is no exception. I love the reveal of the dog-tag of the guy standing there in the testing room, and this</p>
